---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy" description="Draft privacy information for the Friends of Ashley website." noindex>
  <PageHero eyebrow="Draft for review" title="Privacy" intro="This wording is not the final FOA privacy notice." />
  <section class="content-section content-section--compact"><div class="site-width policy-copy"><div class="draft-callout"><strong>Requires formal approval before publication.</strong> Final wording must identify the data controller, processors, retention periods and contact route.</div><h2>Current implementation approach</h2><p>The public site does not provide accounts, accept payments or offer public notice submission. Ticket purchases will take place on an external provider's site.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>FOA can be contacted by email or through the Google Form on the Contact Us page. FOA needs an approved retention and access policy for messages received through these routes.</p><h2>Analytics and external services</h2><p>Analytics is not active. The final notice must explain any analytics, embedded services, ticket provider and Google Form processor before they are enabled.</p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
